{"title":"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the units digit of the sum\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/d/46d3c9f38511a89b99e238905fb6f3747dfd6176.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{i=1}^{100}(i!)^{2}\\]\" width=\"57\" height=\"50\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/2/67268607c8146d4c82df2442d8eb0ae7250eb88a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\,0\\quad\\mathrm{(B)}\\,1\\quad\\mathrm{(C)}\\,3\\quad\\mathrm{(D)}\\,5\\quad\\mathrm{(E)}\\,7\\quad\\mathrm{(F)}\\,9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"318\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If i is less than 5, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/7/067a6a9464534931da3b13baef99efa9636c43b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i!$\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> has a positive units digit, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/7/27733415591a3f4b87dd5ef6745125bf254aec26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i\\geq 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/7/067a6a9464534931da3b13baef99efa9636c43b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i!$\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" /> has a units digit of 0, as does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/c/b5c2efa4c00a46152443d5cba8c8b8a199ada751.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i!)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"31\" height=\"19\" />. So we only need to worry about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/e/50ed4b89a6aeb4814026a2be01bde8bd7d264b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/7/637408a607334921a63245b3f13ec0589ede362c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1!)^2=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"19\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6b9fa4b8e32d5b8e569b8785f800164313933e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2!)^2=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"69\" height=\"19\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/f/28fa0fc4388d477cce5fa33965c3ae6a74d102ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3!)^2=36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/2/5e2df3c2493acd19d73412bfe734aa3d753a13f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4!)^2=576$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"19\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/a/6da03234804f99c20a588b014875d312415d467a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+4+6+6=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" />, which has a units digit of 7 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/598c140dd07a9e2359d2a073257ea27b86f9bfdd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{(E)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\" /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest\" title=\"2007 iTest\">2007 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 iTest Answer Key\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_iTest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 iTest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/ind